00:15:44,980 --> 00:15:47,100
这话什么意思 难道你还是受害人吗
So what are you saying? You're the victim here?

343
00:15:47,680 --> 00:15:49,480
万一苏菲回来 看见你坐在这里
What would Sophie say if she came home

344
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:50,480
她会怎么说
and saw you sitting here?

345
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:52,720
她会说"别搞夜视镜了 搞我吧"
She'd say, "Stop hogging the goggles."

346
00:15:54,040 --> 00:15:55,820
奥列格 我就这么说吧
Oleg, let me just say this:

347
00:15:56,020 --> 00:15:58,000
佛蒙特州其实比你想象中要近
Vermont is closer than you think.

348
00:15:58,220 --> 00:15:59,920
我不懂这有什么好吵的
I don't know where this argument is going,

349
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:01,960
但老子要下楼参加超模派对啦
but I'm going to that damn supermodel party.

350
00:16:02,300 --> 00:16:05,180
奥列格 已经很晚了 我就直截了当地说吧
Oleg, it's late, I'm gonna lay this on the line for you.

351
00:16:05,620 --> 00:16:06,780
你不是乔治·克鲁尼
You're no George Clooney.

352
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:08,880
你连乔治·克斯坦萨都不如
You're not even george costanza.

353
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:12,200
这床单超棒
These sheets are amazing

354
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:14,260
你永远也找不到比苏菲更好的女人了
and you are never gonna do better than Sophie.

355
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:15,680
她身材火爆
She is hot

356
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:17,440
而且显然她闻不到你的体臭
and clearly has no sense of smell.

357
00:16:19,420 --> 00:16:20,620
我爱苏菲
I love Sophie.

358
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:22,060
我会乖乖回家
I'll go home.

359
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,240
转念一想 我还是不相信自己
On second thought, I don't trust myself

360
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:27,360
能心无邪念从你们家门口走过
to walk by your apartment.

361
00:16:27,580 --> 00:16:28,880
把我锁在这里吧
Better lock me in here.

362
00:16:30,340 --> 00:16:32,840
卡洛琳 麦克斯 快下来
Caroline! Max! Come down here! Hurry!

363
00:16:33,220 --> 00:16:34,720
我就知道 听见了吗 麦克斯
I knew it! See, Max?

364
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:35,920
她们求着我们下去呢
They're begging us to come.

365
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:36,980
老娘重回时尚圈了
I'm back again.

366
00:16:37,340 --> 00:16:38,300
你要一起来吗
Are you coming?

367
00:16:38,660 --> 00:16:39,640
让我想想
Oh, let me think.

368
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:41,860
下楼尽情畅饮 或是在楼上
Downstairs with an open bar or up here,

369
00:16:41,860 --> 00:16:45,831
跟小裤裤脏脏的奥列格独处呢
alone, with Oleg in his tighty-not-that-whities?

370
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:49,360
我们应该把你绑起来吗
Should we tie you up?

371
00:16:49,740 --> 00:16:52,000
不必了 那只会更让我欲火焚身
No, it'll just make me hornier.

372
00:16:58,620 --> 00:17:00,920
我就知道她们想让我们参加派对
I knew they wanted us to come to the party!

373
00:17:01,020 --> 00:17:01,860
怎么可能不想呢
How could they not?

374
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,980
昨晚我教佩特拉吃面包的新方法
Last night I taught Petra how to eat bread

375
00:17:03,980 --> 00:17:06,020
让她可以不用撕成一小块一小块吃
without tearing it into little pieces first.

376
00:17:07,060 --> 00:17:09,340
想都别想 我可是海豹突击队的
Don't try it. I was a Navy Seal.

377
00:17:09,340 --> 00:17:10,620
你觉得你很猛是吗
You think you're tough?

378
00:17:10,740 --> 00:17:12,760
我曾在冰箱包装盒里住了一个月
I lived in a refrigerator box for a month.

379
00:17:13,220 --> 00:17:14,200
不穿上衣哦[没有顶盖]
With no top.

380
00:17:14,580 --> 00:17:15,940
不是包装盒 是我
Not the box. Me.

381
00:17:17,380 --> 00:17:19,180
麦克斯 卡洛琳 快进来
Max, Caroline, get in here.

382
00:17:19,340 --> 00:17:19,760
来了
Hey!

383
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:21,920
瞧 那就是我们的邀请函
See we were invited.

384
00:17:22,140 --> 00:17:23,040
因为我们是大牌
'cause we're "A" list.

385
00:17:24,100 --> 00:17:25,920
厕所堵了
The toilet is clogged

386
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:27,940
我需要你们处理一下 拜托了
and I need you to take care of it, please.

387
00:17:29,580 --> 00:17:30,380
"大牌"指的是
"A list"

388
00:17:30,620 --> 00:17:32,100
是打扫界的"大牌"人物吗
as in "A" janitor list.

389
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:35,440
我不知道该怎么办
I don't know what to do.

390
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:37,300
你们谁能帮忙叫下管理员吗
Can one of you call the concierge?

391
00:17:37,300 --> 00:17:38,500
当然可以 卡洛琳
Sure. Caroline!

392
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:41,480
等等 等等 你们叫我们下来
Wait, wait, wait-- you didn't just call us down here

393
00:17:41,580 --> 00:17:42,960
不是因为厕所堵了吧
'cause the toilet's clogged, did you?

394
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:43,480
不是
No.

395
00:17:43,700 --> 00:17:44,480
那就好
Okay, good.

396
00:17:44,580 --> 00:17:46,140
厨房水池也堵了
The kitchen sink is backed up, too.

397
00:17:47,840 --> 00:17:48,680
厕所交给我处理
But, toilet, I got this.

398
00:17:48,740 --> 00:17:50,000
我差点就在厕所出生的
I was almost born in one.

399
00:17:50,700 --> 00:17:53,360
借过 借过 借过
Excuse me, excuse me, excuse me, excuse me.

400
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:55,900
好啦 大家淡定
All right, everyone just calm down.

401
00:17:55,980 --> 00:17:57,640
无需惊慌
No need to overreact.

402
00:18:02,380 --> 00:18:04,860
这是广告里提到的"泳池"
And there's the pool we mentioned in our ad.

403
00:18:06,140 --> 00:18:06,980
天啊
Oh, boy.

404
00:18:06,980 --> 00:18:09,524
没错 里面有几坨漂浮物
Yup, we got some floaters.

405
00:18:10,220 --> 00:18:12,880
卡洛琳 我需要皮搋子和额叶切除手术
Caroline, I'm gonna need the plunger and a lobotomy.

406
00:18:13,680 --> 00:18:15,580
老式厕所就这样
This happens with vintage toilets.

407
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,220
也算古色古香的魅力之一吧
Part of their old-world charm.

408
00:18:17,860 --> 00:18:20,000
有些"魅力"沾到你的丝瓜络了
We got some charm stuck on your loofah.

409
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:22,940
姑娘们 还记得昨晚
Hey guys, remember last night

410
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:25,100
我们不用嘴嚼就能吃面包吗
how we just bit into that bread without chewing it?

411
00:18:25,360 --> 00:18:26,060
勿忘美好时光
Good times.

412
00:18:27,540 --> 00:18:30,700
快给我皮搋子 我可不想就这样"屎"掉
I need that damn plunger, I don't want to die this way.

413
00:18:31,500 --> 00:18:33,840
找到了 但好像吸住什么东西了
Got it, but it's caught on something.

414
00:18:44,100 --> 00:18:46,317
这到底是什么垃圾房子啊
What kind of a dump is this?

415
00:18:46,317 --> 00:18:48,800
是你自己要体验威廉斯堡的生活
Hey! You wanted the Williamsburg experience,

416
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:49,940
这就是啊
this is it!

417
00:18:57,820 --> 00:18:59,920
好消息 玛莎 我把你的直发器
Good news, Martha. I have your flat iron

418
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,420
恢复得跟以前差不多啦
looking pretty much back to normal.

419
00:19:02,160 --> 00:19:04,920
太好了 留着吧
Oh, that's good. Keep it.

420
00:19:06,500 --> 00:19:09,880
很抱歉弄脏了你的高级羊绒衫
Again, sorry about your cashmere sweaters in here.

421
00:19:10,420 --> 00:19:11,980
但当时我们厕纸没了
But when we ran out of paper towels,

422
00:19:12,140 --> 00:19:14,860
你的确喊了"随便用什么都行"
you did scream, "Just use anything, make it stop."

423
00:19:15,820 --> 00:19:18,380
当然 我们会出钱送干洗的
And of course, we'll pay to have them all dry cleaned.

424
00:19:18,920 --> 00:19:20,740
你们真好 留着吧
Oh, that's nice. Keep them.

425
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:24,300
好了 我们可以走了
Okay, we can leave.

426
00:19:24,360 --> 00:19:26,640
我跟我的心理医生打完电话了
I am off the phone with my therapist.

427
00:19:27,220 --> 00:19:28,800
不用你们说
And it goes without saying,

428
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:30,620
我们肯定也不会收你们的房钱
we won't charge you guys for this weekend.

429
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:32,360
不行 给
No way. Here.

430
00:19:32,360 --> 00:19:35,940
务必收下这张支票和我心理医生的电话
You are taking this check and my therapist's phone number.

431
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:38,420
我真不知道没有他 你们怎么受得了这房子
I do not know how you are standing up without him.

432
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:40,580
拜托 这算什么呀
What? Come on, this is nothing.

433
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:43,440
地板还曾经真的张开嘴把我俩吞掉了呢
One month, the floor actually opened up and swallowed us.

434
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:45,600
是呀 我们遇到过更糟糕的情况呢
Yeah, we've been through worse.

435
00:19:45,940 --> 00:19:48,439
你们俩相互支撑扶持的方式真酷
Oh, it's really cool the way you two support each other.

436
00:19:48,439 --> 00:19:52,210
是啊 我们是一双"护"腿长袜
Yup, we're a pair of support hose.

437
00:19:52,540 --> 00:19:54,000
说到"支撑"
And speaking of support--

438
00:19:55,100 --> 00:19:56,100
给 麦克斯
Here, Max.

439
00:19:56,100 --> 00:19:57,160
不是吧
No way!

440
00:19:57,940 --> 00:19:59,200
瞧 卡洛琳 我的内衣大集合耶
Look, Caroline, it's a Bra-nanza!

441
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:03,320
卡洛琳 因为你实在没必要穿内衣
And, Caroline, since you don't really need to wear a bra...

442
00:20:05,180 --> 00:20:07,720
给 这间公寓可能是地狱
Here. This apartment may be hell,

443
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:09,720
但你是一个真正的天使
but you are a real angel.

444
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:12,440
哇 属于我的翅膀
Aw, my own wings?

445
00:20:12,940 --> 00:20:14,400
谢谢你们
Thank you, guys.

446
00:20:15,340 --> 00:20:16,740
我能问你们一件事吗
Hey, can I ask you something?

447
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:19,600
只要跟老鼠无关的都行
As long as it doesn't have anything to do with rats.

448
00:20:21,300 --> 00:20:23,060
你们为什么不邀请我们参加派对呢
How come you didn't invite us to the party?

449
00:20:23,060 --> 00:20:25,420
什么 我以为玛莎邀请了呀
What? I thought Martha did.

450
00:20:25,620 --> 00:20:26,739
我以为莉莉邀请了
I thought Lily did.

451
00:20:26,739 --> 00:20:29,271
模特少根筋
Model moment!

452
00:20:32,661 --> 00:20:34,864
上菜 卡洛琳
Pick-up, Caroline!

453
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:41,200
我就知道你会死在这里
Yup, I always knew you would die here.

454
00:20:45,282 --> 00:20:47,396
上菜 麦克斯
Pick-up, Max!

455
00:20:49,280 --> 00:20:51,040
看起来不错嘛 麦克斯
Looking good, Max.

456
00:20:51,540 --> 00:20:53,760
你上完菜后 让卡洛琳进厨房
After you drop that, have Caroline come back here

457
00:20:53,760 --> 00:20:55,740
把我关进冷库 等苏菲回来再放我出来
and lock me in the walk-in till Sophie gets home.

458
00:20:56,580 --> 00:21:00,500
麦克斯 我刚意识到我们算是服务员界的超模
Max, I just realized we're kind of the supermodels of waitressing.

459
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:04,020
我也刚意识到 原来我的咪咪可以不用来回乱撞
And I just realized my boobs aren't always supposed to hit my side.
